      "sourceTextSha256": "1f9576b4647525926cbbd4e1855df9218258a0b7e644d2a2004cbf2addc00d7f",
      "text": "After breakfast, the lodge's activities begin.\n\n\n\n\n**Photo safari.** The variety of wildlife, birds and plants gives you plenty of opportunities to photograph scenes in nature as you explore the reserve.\n\n\n\n\n**Horseback riding across flooded grasslands.** The horses wade through water and marshy ground, taking you to places that would be harder to reach on foot.\n\n\n\n\n**Boat ride.** During the day, you have more chances to spot wildlife and photograph the landscape. You can also arrange a night ride before dinner. Look for stars overhead and the occasional glint of a caiman's eyes in the dark.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw9gadwe-mr8jrl3dx",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
