      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "61c02273d5bfb7ef698610d4dd800a8f1af2e8b6c202c6b2b58f5921d1e63380",
      "text": "Activities continue according to the lodge's programme.\n\n\n\n\nYou spend the whole day in Iberá. Keep watching for birds and other wildlife, head out on the water or choose another activity offered by the lodge.\n\n\n\n\nSpending several days in the reserve lets you see it in the early morning, in the heat of the day and as evening settles over the water. This is the part of the journey that feels most different from a typical sightseeing trip in Argentina.",
